        "https://catalog.utdallas.edu/2025/undergraduate/programs/jsom/computer-information-systems-and-technology (2026-07-27 13:40:18) 5/",
        "The BS CIST degree program requires students to focus on a specific concentration to obtain in-",
        "depth knowledge in a particular business area.",
        "Students may choose 9 semester credit hours from one of the following Concentrations.",
        "A. Concentration in Business Intelligence and Analytics",
        "Students who wish to focus on analytical applications on a firm technical foundation can choose",
        "the Concentration in Business Intelligence and Analytics, which requires a choice of three of the",
        "Students who wish to focus on the internal, integrated information systems within an organization",
        "Students who wish to focus on sales of technical products and services, must take the following",
        "https://catalog.utdallas.edu/2025/undergraduate/programs/jsom/computer-information-systems-and-technology (2026-07-27 13:40:18) 6/",
        "D. Concentration in IT Innovation and Entrepreneurship",
        "Students who wish to focus development of new technical products in a start-up environment,",
        "Students who wish to focus on cybersecurity within a firm technical foundation can choose the",
        "Concentration in Cybersecurity, which requires the three following courses for a total of 9",
        "F. Concentration in Information Technology and Systems",
        "that are not part of the BS CIST major preparatory, major core, or major related courses may be",
        "used to satisfy the 9 semester credit hours of guided elective credit.",
        "and/or an Individual Study based on the major to satisfy JURS program requirements. These",
        "credits may be applied to the general concentration."
